# busybox init. One respawn entry per daemon so a dead process is restarted.
# BusyBox restarts a respawn entry about a second after it exits and does
# not stop retrying. A failed config check does not exit: the start script
# execs sleep with a distinct argument (1001 nginx, 1002 NSD).
::respawn:/usr/local/bin/start_syslog
::respawn:/usr/local/bin/start_api
::respawn:/usr/local/bin/start_controller
::respawn:/usr/local/bin/start_dns_udp
::respawn:/usr/local/bin/start_dns_axfr
::respawn:/usr/local/bin/start_nsd
::respawn:/usr/local/bin/start_nginx
::respawn:/usr/local/bin/start_cron
::shutdown:/usr/local/bin/start_shutdown
